# q064 products_by_category_shared_predicate_dataset
# Intent: E1 shared-predicate group-by. `edw:category` is a PLAIN column on BOTH
#   DIM_PRODUCT (edw:Product, .../product/{PRODUCT_KEY}) and FACT_SUPPORT_TICKET
#   (edw:SupportTicket, .../ticket/{TICKET_KEY}) — disjoint subject templates.
#   Before E1, the shared predicate made class_fusion_is_safe refuse to fuse the
#   `a edw:Product` type into the star, emitting a 2-pattern shape (star + a
#   separate class-only scan) that failed the fused single-pattern gate → decline
#   → materialize. E1 fuses it to a single DIM_PRODUCT scan. This mirrors the
#   deployed Product-by-category timeout (#7/#10).
# BI lineage: "How many products are in each category?" (dataset path)
# Predicates verified against enterprise.ttl — DimProduct: category (a plain column
#   shared with FactSupportTicket).
# Exec path: query_from() with FROM <enterprise-sf01-v:main> (the deployed solo shape).
PREFIX edw: <http://ns.fluree.dev/edw#>
SELECT ?cat (COUNT(?p) AS ?n)
FROM <enterprise-sf01-v:main>
WHERE { ?p a edw:Product ; edw:category ?cat . }
GROUP BY ?cat
